ed it paul dana was riddler  was straight out of a horror movie colin  farrell john turturro zoe kravitz and  jeffrey wright were all phenomenal matt  reeves made a masterpiece of a movie  holy sh  oh take it easy sweetheart while the  batman may be a standalone movie there  was no way this new adventure wasn't  going to be compared to the dark knight  which many long hailed is the best  superhero movie of all time fans who  were able to catch the new film early  started comparing it to the christopher  nolan film right away  one fan commented the batman is the  second best superhero movie of all time  just behind the dark knight another fan  lapped on more praise saying matt reeves  gave me the batman film of my dreams  something i've been waiting for since  batman the animated series i've never  seen something and i've been absolutely  sure of something but i'm 100 sure this  is the best batman film we've ever  gotten and my absolute favorite ever  overall it seems like the batman has  cemented itself as one of the greatest  comic book movies of all time while it  technically is a superhero movie it  doesn't necessarily feel like one the  batman is an action thriller to its core  and fans couldn't be happier with it  some of the comments included 10 out of  10 this is a live-action batman film  i've always wanted  the batman was so amazing i'm shaking  just walked out of the batman and they  have no words  they nailed the batman from start to  finish  the batman is a masterpiece one of the  best superhero movies ever all in all  fans of the dark knight are not going to  be disappointed with the batman which  sounds from our reactions like it's been  worth the years of hype when that light  hits the sky  it's not just a call  that's so mourning  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the batman are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

